# Testing

No behavior change is complete without tests. DoD: [definition-of-done.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/definition-of-done.mdc). Suite QA: `docs/renverse/11_QA_CHECKLIST.md`.

- **Every change includes**
  - Code + tests colocated under `apps/api`, `apps/web`, `packages/`, or existing test hubs
  - Do not drop one-off tests in repo root scratch folders

- **When this applies**
  - Auth / org membership / suite OIDC
  - `hasAddon('smartload')` gates on API and UI
  - POD confirm + Connect outbox (`smartload.pod.confirmed.v1` only)
  - Identity event consumers
  - ISSA tool callbacks
  - Deep link `/suite/open`
  - Scan / dispatch / inventory within policy

- **Mandatory scenarios (every feature)**
  - Positive: valid input, allowed principal, success
  - Negative: invalid input, denied principal, failed validation
  - Security: unauth, **addon bypass**, cross-org IDOR, unsafe payload
  - Dual-mode: suite path and standalone path when both exist
  - Addon absent: core suite apps unaffected; SmartLoad returns 403

- **Failures**
  - Do not delete tests or weaken assertions to pass
  - Fix root cause; classify app vs test vs env vs flake
